{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>日本爆紅「香脆蒜片辣椒油」</h2>\n<p>說到日本必買調味料，這款桃屋「辛そうで辛くない少し辛いラー油」絕對值得一試！以大量香脆炸蒜和炸洋蔥為主角，一開蓋便蒜香四溢，令人食慾大增。每一口都能咬到酥脆的蒜粒，越嚼越香，蒜香與油香交織，令人一試上癮，停不了口。\n</p>\n<h2>撈飯撈麵都正!</h2>\n<p>雖然名為「辣椒油」，但辣度其實不高，反而以蒜香和香辣味最為突出。對於不太能吃辣的朋友來說，這款辣椒油絕對是友好之選，無論是配白飯、餃子、拉麵，還是拌麵，這款辣椒油都能完美融入。在大生及HKTVmall均可買到這款人氣調味料。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551443202854124_3040247216b05604082ed7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551443202854124_3040247216b05604082ed7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551443435298051_13982981416b056042c2689.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551443435298051_13982981416b056042c2689.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551443646957607_1172543636b05604506a44.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551443646957607_1172543636b05604506a44.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgHfM0_E5jJ/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:23:59.631477+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_a